# mod-custom-spells: the Druid custom class spells (the /spells picker) on a
# bot. Every check states the CONCEPT's behaviour (share-public
# custom-spells/08-rework-20261008.md), so a FAIL marks a defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150). Melee chains only jump to
# units in front of the caster, so chain checks stand west of the ring facing
# it; self-centred AoEs stand in its middle. Slot 4 belongs to the cs_*
# scenarios; the cleanup unlearns every custom spell again.
# Spells: Moonfire 48463 (rank 14: direct part + ticks), Starfall 53201 (rank
# 4, talent, 90-s cooldown; every second 53198 picks 2 enemies, each takes a
# star 53195 and its splash 53190), Swipe (Bear) 48562, Swipe (Cat) 62078,
# Dire Bear Form 9634, Cat Form 768, Thorns 53307, Rejuvenation 48441,
# Regrowth 48443, Lifebloom 48451, Wild Growth 53251 (talent), Force of
# Nature 33831 (talent, three Treants 1964), Flask of the Frost Wyrm 53755
# (+125 spell power), Mark of the Wild 48469, Blessing of Wisdom 48936.
# Normal casts (not triggered) where a proc or a cooldown is checked.
name    Custom spells - Druid
timeout 300s

bot dr druid slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require dr alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near dr
require d1 exists
do gm target dr
as gm .unlearn 901000
as gm .unlearn 901001
as gm .unlearn 901002
as gm .unlearn 901003
as gm .unlearn 901004
as gm .unlearn 901005
as gm .unlearn 901033
as gm .unlearn 901049
as gm .unlearn 901051
as gm .unlearn 901066
as gm .unlearn 901067
as gm .unlearn 901068
as gm .unlearn 901069
as gm .unlearn 901070
as gm .unlearn 901071
as gm .unlearn 901072
as gm .unlearn 901035
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
do dr learn 48463
do dr learn 53201
do dr learn 48562
do dr learn 62078
do dr learn 9634
do dr learn 768
do dr learn 53307
do dr learn 48441
do dr learn 48443
do dr learn 48451
do dr learn 53251
do dr learn 33831
do dr approach d1
wait 1s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Balance
log Balance - 901001 Moonfire +50 % on both parts: the direct hit ('damage', op 0) and the ticks ('dot', op 22)
do dr learn 901001
expect dr spellmod 48463 damage 100 == 150
expect dr spellmod 48463 dot 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 901001

log Balance - 901000 Moonfire +9 targets = 10 targets (jump targets 0 -> 10, wave F); 8 dummies, one miss allowed
do dr learn 901000
expect dr spellmod 48463 jumptargets 0 == 10
spelllog start
do dr cast 48463 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 48463 maxtargets >= 7
as gm .unlearn 901000

log Balance - 901003 Starfall +50 %: its stars (53195) and their splash (53190)
do dr learn 901003
expect dr spellmod 53195 damage 100 == 150
expect dr spellmod 53190 damage 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 901003

log Balance - 901002 Starfall area +50 % (revision 2026-10-08, was +9 targets): the volley's search (53198, 30 yd) and the stars' splash (53190, 5 yd) grow by half
do dr learn 901002
expect dr spellmod 53198 radius 100 == 150
expect dr spellmod 53190 radius 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 901002

log Balance - 901002 control: from 41 yd west of the ring's middle (the dummies 37-45 yd away, the Beast/Dragonkin Training Dummies at (-340, 175/125) 38 yd) Starfall's stars find no target. The search reaches past its 30 yd: + 2.66 yd leeway for a player who is not walking (WorldObject::GetLeewayBonusRadius, standing still too) + the dummy's 1.5-yd reach = 34.2 yd - from 36 yd west (run 482) it found the three nearest dummies (32.1 / 33.4 yd)
do dr goto -311 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
expect dr near -311 150 -423.2 1
expect dr spellmod 53198 radius 100 == 100
spelllog start
do dr cast 53201 triggered
wait 2200ms
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 53195 hits == 0
as gm .unaura 53201

log Balance - 901002 with the passive (45 + 2.66 + 1.5 = 49.2 yd: every dummy of the ring) the same Starfall reaches the ring
do dr learn 901002
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do dr cast 53201 triggered
wait 2200ms
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 53195 hits >= 1
as gm .unaura 53201
as gm .unlearn 901002
do dr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do dr approach d1
wait 500ms

log Balance - 901005 Starfall stacks up to 10: a second Starfall adds a stack
do dr learn 901005
do dr cast 53201 triggered
wait 300ms
do dr cast 53201 triggered
wait 300ms
expect dr aurastacks 53201 >= 2
as gm .unaura 53201
as gm .unlearn 901005

log Balance - 901004 dealing spell damage takes 1 s off Starfall's cooldown (1 s ICD): a normal Starfall (90 s), then 4 normal Moonfires; natively 83 s are left after 6.9 s
do dr reset
do dr learn 901004
do dr cast 53201
wait 1600ms
do dr cast 48463 on d1
wait 1600ms
do dr cast 48463 on d1
wait 1600ms
do dr cast 48463 on d1
wait 1600ms
do dr cast 48463 on d1
wait 500ms
expect dr cooldown 53201 < 81000
as gm .unaura 53201
as gm .unlearn 901004

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feral
log Feral - 901033 Swipe (Bear) applies a bleed (901034) to every enemy it hits (Dire Bear Form, from the ring's middle)
do dr learn 901033
do dr goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do dr cast 9634 triggered
wait 500ms
spelllog start
do dr cast 48562 triggered
wait 3500ms
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 48562 maxtargets >= 6
expect dr spell 901034 targets >= 6
as gm .unaura 9634
as gm .unlearn 901033

log Feral - 901049 Swipe (Cat) applies a bleed (901050) to every enemy it hits (Cat Form; a melee chain in front of you, from the west)
do dr learn 901049
do dr goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do dr approach d1
do dr cast 768 triggered
wait 500ms
spelllog start
do dr cast 62078 on d1 triggered
wait 3500ms
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 62078 maxtargets >= 6
expect dr spell 901050 targets >= 6
as gm .unaura 768
as gm .unlearn 901049

log Feral - 901051 Energy regeneration +50 % (entering Cat Form empties the bar; after 2 s: 20 natively, 30 with the passive)
wait 300ms
do dr cast 768 triggered
wait 2s
expect dr power energy <= 24
as gm .unaura 768
do dr learn 901051
wait 300ms
do dr cast 768 triggered
wait 2s
expect dr power energy >= 27
as gm .unaura 768
as gm .unlearn 901051

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Restoration
log Restoration - 901070 HoTs heal +50 %: the ticks ('dot', op 22) of Rejuvenation, Regrowth, Lifebloom and Wild Growth
do dr learn 901070
expect dr spellmod 48441 dot 100 == 150
expect dr spellmod 48443 dot 100 == 150
expect dr spellmod 48451 dot 100 == 150
expect dr spellmod 53251 dot 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 901070

log Restoration - 901071 CONCEPT: HoTs tick twice as fast (periodic interval, op 19: 3000 -> 1500 ms) and last twice as long (Rejuvenation 15 -> 30 s)
do dr learn 901071
expect dr spellmod 48441 19 3000 == 1500
expect dr spellmod 48441 duration 15000 == 30000
as gm .unlearn 901071

log Restoration - setup for the summon passives: Flask of the Frost Wyrm (+125 spell power), three Force of Nature Treants (1964)
as gm .aura 53755
wait 500ms
do dr cast 33831 at d1 triggered
wait 1s
expect dr minions 1964 == 3
pick tr creature:1964 near dr
require tr exists
track tr

log Restoration - 901066 HoT ticks have a 5 % chance (5 s ICD) to summon a Healing Treant (901066) - statistical: Lifebloom, Wild Growth, Rejuvenation and Regrowth on the bot and the director (about 5 ticks a second), two rounds
do dr learn 901066
as gm .damage 3000
do gm target gm
as gm .damage 3000
do gm target dr
do dr cast 48451 on dr triggered
do dr cast 48451 on gm triggered
do dr cast 53251 on dr triggered
do dr cast 48441 on dr triggered
do dr cast 48441 on gm triggered
do dr cast 48443 on dr triggered
do dr cast 48443 on gm triggered
wait 7s
do dr cast 48451 on dr triggered
do dr cast 48451 on gm triggered
do dr cast 53251 on dr triggered
waitfor dr minions 901066 >= 1 timeout 8s
as gm .unlearn 901066
pick ht creature:901066 near dr
track ht

log Restoration - 901067 summons scale with healing power: a Force of Nature Treant and the Healing Treant gain health once the passive is on
mark m1
do dr learn 901067
wait 4s
expect tr health > mark:m1
expect ht health > mark:m1

log Restoration - 901068 a summon heals around it (901073) when it dies ...
do dr learn 901068
as gm .damage 2000
spelllog start
do gm target tr
as gm .die
do gm target dr
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 901073 casts >= 1

log Restoration - 901068 CONCEPT: ... and when it despawns - the other two Treants and the Healing Treant run out (30 s) while the next checks run, inside one spell-log window
spelllog start

log Restoration - 901069 Thorns gives a chance to cast Rejuvenation on its targets: 20 hits on the druid with its own Thorns - statistical (20 % a hit)
do dr learn 901069
as gm .unaura 48441
do dr cast 53307 on dr triggered
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
expect dr aura 48441

log Restoration - 901069 CONCEPT: the same on another Thorns target - the director with the druid's Thorns takes 20 hits
do gm target gm
as gm .unaura 48441
do dr cast 53307 on gm triggered
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
as gm .damage 10
expect gm aura 48441
as gm .unaura 53307
as gm .unaura 48441
do gm reset
do gm target dr
as gm .unaura 53307
as gm .unlearn 901069

log Restoration - 901072 CONCEPT: mana regeneration +2 % per 1 % missing mana - mana regained in 10 s from 592 of 5916 (10 %), without and then with the passive (Mark of the Wild + Blessing of Wisdom, no casts, Lifebloom removed unbloomed - its bloom refunds mana): about 265 natively, so at least 592 + 2 x 265 = 1122 with it (x2.8 at 10 %)
as gm .unaura 48451
do gm target gm
as gm .unaura 48451
do gm target dr
as gm .aura 48469
as gm .aura 48936
as gm .modify mana 592
as gm .unaura 48469
as gm .aura 48469
expect dr power mana <= 650
wait 10s
expect dr power mana > 592
do dr learn 901072
wait 1s
as gm .modify mana 592
as gm .unaura 48469
as gm .aura 48469
wait 10s
expect dr power mana >= 1122
as gm .unlearn 901072

log Restoration - 901068 CONCEPT (end of the window): a despawning summon heals around it
waitfor dr minions 1964 == 0 timeout 30s
waitfor dr minions 901066 == 0 timeout 30s
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 901073 casts >= 1

cleanup
do dr stop
do gm target gm
as gm .unaura 53307
as gm .unaura 48441
as gm .unaura 48443
as gm .unaura 48451
as gm .unaura 53251
do gm target dr
as gm .unaura 768
as gm .unaura 9634
as gm .unaura 53201
as gm .unaura 53307
as gm .unaura 48441
as gm .unaura 48443
as gm .unaura 48451
as gm .unaura 53251
as gm .unaura 48469
as gm .unaura 48936
as gm .unaura 53755
as gm .unlearn 901000
as gm .unlearn 901001
as gm .unlearn 901002
as gm .unlearn 901003
as gm .unlearn 901004
as gm .unlearn 901005
as gm .unlearn 901033
as gm .unlearn 901049
as gm .unlearn 901051
as gm .unlearn 901066
as gm .unlearn 901067
as gm .unlearn 901068
as gm .unlearn 901069
as gm .unlearn 901070
as gm .unlearn 901071
as gm .unlearn 901072
as gm .unlearn 901035
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
